#29700
"Before a White Fortress"
"Before you is an ominous fortress made of the purest white-marble.  The white
of the fortress contrasts nicely with the gray-white background of the
mountain.  The fortress looms several stories up reaching towards the sky with
an occasional spike jutting out from the high walls.  Two towers, one each on
either side of the entrance stands firm against the shadows.  There is an
eerie ambience encompassing the fortress for no guards or gate can be seen.
No scratches or cracks can be seen anywhere on the surface of the fortress.
There is an opening leading south into the heart of the quiet fortress and a
faint path leading north back towards the mountain trail.
"
""
