#29702
"White Fortress Storage Room"
"Set into the north wall is a massive adamantine safe with an even more
impressive combination lock system.  The walls and ceiling of this room hum
and glow, illuminating the room, chasing away the shadows.  Treasure chests of
all shapes, sizes, and colors cover the floor like a carpet.  On the west wall
there is a picture of a man in shiny black metal armor wielding a glowing
sword.  Surrounding the man in black are three humanoids that appear to be
chanting a spell.  There is a hallway leading back north to the heart of the
fortress.
"
"[Orb] THIS IS A STORAGE ROOM.  DO NOT PURGE!
[Orb] This attaches to 29701.
"
