#29703
"White Fortress - Hallway"
"As you enter the hallway, the floor and ceiling spring to life lighting up the
room with the sound of echoing hums.  Nothing of notice catches your eye in
this bleak hallway.  A soft breeze floats by smelling of fresh baked bread.
The occasional faint sound of a pan clanging reverberates off the walls.  The
hallways stops suddenly then veers off towards the south.  The only other exit
is back west towards the heart of the fortress.
"
