#29704
"White Fortress - Intersection"
"As you enter the hallway, the floor and ceiling spring to life lighting up the
room with the sound of echoing hums.  The spices from some fresh vegetables
create a tingling sensation in your nose.  The source of the exotic smells and
the clanging of pots seem to be coming from the hallway to the east.  A huge
portrait hangs on the west wall.  The humanoid portrayed in it resembles that
of an elf, yet is taller and more filled out.  In the background, a village of
troll-like citizens are frozen in time, eternally doing their everyday chores.
There is a hallway leading south, deeper into the fortress, and one leading
north back to the entrance.
"
"south is 29707
