#29705
"White Fortress - Dining Room"
"The ceiling and floors are already glowing when you enter.  Rows of oak tables
neatly line the floor, probably enough to seat an army.  Two oak benches are
located on opposite sides of the tables, ready to support hungry guests.  Each
of the tables has already been prepped for the main course.  Silk napkins,
forks, spoons, and knives are delicately distributed beside the clay plates.
The only two exits, a hallway leading back west to the entrance, and a doorway
leading east towards the kitchen.
"
""
