#29706
"White Fortress - Kitchen"
"The eclectic smells and sights overwhelm your senses.  Fresh-picked berries
sit next to a bowl of freshly tossed bowl of potato salad.  Baked bread rests
on the table still warm from the brick-oven stove.  A rack attacked to the
ceiling holds a variety of pots and saucepans.  The ceiling is glowing a gray
color, probably due to the accumulation of soot from the fire.  The floor is
littered with spilled spices and squished fruits.  A shiny silver bell is
sitting on the thick oak table waiting to be rung.  The only exit is back west
towards the dinning room.
"
