#29707
"White Fortress - Bar"
"This room is only lit by candlelight, creating eerie shadows.  In the center
of the room is an oval shaped bar with a heavily polished wooden countertop.
The bright mithril border surrounding the countertop contrasts nicely with the
darker wood.  Hanging from the ceiling, following the trail of the countertop
is an assortment of shot and wine glasses.  Scattered out across the room are
a dozen wooden tables with a compliment of four chairs at each table.
Eclectic collections of alcoholic beverages are stacked neatly in the inner
part of the countertop.  There is a hallway leading north, back to the
entrance, and a hallway leading west, deeper into the fortress.
"
""
